### 3.1 Metadata preflight

Подготовлен disjoint train support/calibration preflight:

- 14 exact-symmetric категорий;
- 340 positive и 340 negative records в каждом support/calibration cell;
- 19,040 cell records;
- 15,543 уникальных physical ImageID;
