## 4. Derived DINOv3 64-token store

Реализован отдельный derived contract, не изменяющий legacy full441 schemas.

Transformation:

```text
[1,441,1024] FP16
-> CPU FP32 reshape 21x21
-> adaptive_avg_pool2d 8x8
-> [1,64,1024] contiguous FP16
```

Derived lineage включает:

- parent serialized manifest SHA;
- parent artifact SHA для каждого RGB;
- canonical reducer object и reducer SHA;
- exact representation ID;
- exact embedding shape;
- tensor SHA и artifact file SHA.

Артефакт:

- root: `/mnt/datasets/embeddings/public_gt_b1_dinov3l336_aap8x8_64_v1_20260802`
- artifact count: 6,533;
- size: 846 MiB;
- manifest SHA-256: `490c402a5d2a271168b73536806cc8be784a7e928d060801c635c284c54ca604`.

Focused derived-store implementation suite от worker:

- `135 passed`.

